# Flight API (`dondron_flight_api`)

Generic interface between companion computer and PX4. **Detection-agnostic.**

## Topics

| Topic | Type | Direction |
|-------|------|-----------|
| `/flight_api/cmd_setpoint` | project-specific or `geometry_msgs` twist | subscribe |
| PX4 offboard | `px4_msgs/msg/TrajectorySetpoint` via uXRCE-DDS | publish |

## Must not

- Subscribe to `/detections`
- Contain visual servo or intercept logic
- Map bbox errors to setpoints (Module C — private repo only)

## Responsibilities

- Frame transforms (body ↔ NED)
- Offboard mode management and setpoint validation
- Optional test harness: manual joystick or waypoint publisher for bench tests

